∇ r←AnonymiserTest file;t;fakes;planted;out;map;allow
 ⍝ Plant a student name and instructor names (one a prefix of another, so
 ⍝ replacement order matters) into a fixture, anonymise, and check they're gone.
  t←ReadRaw file
  allow←Unrecognised t
  fakes←2↑Instructors⊃##.uwsch t
  planted←'Jane Quinn-Doe' 'Ann Lau' 'Ann Lauritzen'
  t←(((⊂FakeStudent),fakes)planted)Replace t
  (out map)←allow AnonymiseText t
  r←''
  r,←(0<≢planted Leaks out)/'planted names survived. '
  r,←(FakeStudent≢StudentName out)/'student not replaced. '
  r,←((Stable Ics t)≢map Unmap Stable Ics out)/'calendar changed. '
∇
